{"id":"n58114-1-3","stage":0,"title":"사 · 四","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58114-1-3-1","ko":"몇 명이나 오는 거지?","zh":"到底会来几个人呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}},{"text":"명이나","meaning":"人（强调数量）","explanation":"명：人数的量词；-이나 在这里强调询问的人数。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"명이나","audio":"/audio/aa9f4c774afa196a54bb.mp3"}},{"text":"오는","meaning":"来，来参加","explanation":"오다：来，来参加；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"12","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오는","audio":"/audio/204311ae50badf5e3adb.mp3"}},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"会……呢？","explanation":"거 把前面的 오는 名词化，-지? 在这里表示自问或向对方求确认：会来几个人呢？","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거지","audio":"/audio/a9e973ff709d931a2b92.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，来参加","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了参与某个有目的性的聚会而从另一个地方转移到这个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term"